// Every Minecraft 1.0.0 block, by original numeric ID (see docs/blocks-and-items.md).
//
// textures: names in assets/textures/blocks/ (without .png), per face. The most
// specific field wins: north/south/east/west, then top/bottom, then end (top +
// bottom) or side (four sides), then all. Blocks with a "front" use south.
// Leave textures out for blocks that draw nothing.
//
// tint: None (default), GrassTop, Grass, Foliage or Fixed(0xRRGGBB).
//
// Data values (wool colors, log types, crop stages, door halves...) and the
// remaining block properties are added in M2.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
    (id: 0, name: "air"),
    (id: 1, name: "stone", textures: (all: "stone")),
    (id: 2, name: "grass", textures: (all: "dirt", top: "grass_top", side: "grass_side"), tint: GrassTop),
    (id: 3, name: "dirt", textures: (all: "dirt")),
    (id: 4, name: "cobblestone", textures: (all: "cobblestone")),
